Description:
  Reconstructs fixed-target laboratory kinematics from the incoming and
  highest-energy prompt outgoing positive muon, excluding leptons from
  hadron decays. The primary selection uses
  Q2 > 1 GeV2, 0.1 < y < 0.9, W2 > 12 GeV2, and 0.0025 < x < 0.7,
  with Q2 <= 190 GeV2. Raw ordinary, inverse-D, and covariance-proxy
  cross sections are supplied for external physical-helicity
  POSNLO+NEGNLO combination. A Q2 > 4 GeV2 validation selection is also
  provided. D includes the muon mass and the E143 R1998 fit. The A1
  extraction follows COMPASS in neglecting eta A2.
